      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "card",
      "description": "Carte signature flottante : la garantie au premier plan.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-proof\"><div class=\"ds-proof-top\"><span class=\"ds-proof-ic\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></span><span><strong>Course protégée</strong><small>Suivi et preuves à chaque étape</small></span></div><div class=\"ds-proof-foot\"><span>Paiement sécurisé</span><b>Vérifié</b></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-proof{width:236px;padding:16px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #edf0ed;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 15px 45px #142b1d1c;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-proof-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px}.ds-proof-ic{width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:10px;background:#e8f4e9;color:#276548}.ds-proof strong{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#22372d}.ds-proof small{display:block;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;color:#56635c}.ds-proof-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid #edf0ed;margin-top:13px;padding-top:11px;font-size:11px;color:#56635c}.ds-proof-foot b{color:#2d7955}"
